        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURE: PEACEFUL MODE! 🕊️ <i>Peaceful mode with no monsters. Just stock shelves, watch out for thieves, and grow your store!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird Store Simulator is a fun FPV (First Person) store management shooter. Organize your shelves, restock products, and keep your customers happy. But stay alert — zombies, thieves, and aliens can attack your store anytime. Survive and grow your business!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if zombies, thieves, or even aliens attacked your store every day… Could you really keep it running?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shelves, keep your customers happy, and grow your market. But don’t forget: you must stand strong against the monsters trying to take over your shop! A unique survival experience that combines management and defense is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Running a store has never been this strange!</strong><br>Fill your shelves, manage your products, and keep your customers happy. But be careful — not everyone who walks in just wants to shop. Zombies, creatures, and even bandits are after your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to keep the business running while also defending it from every threat. Stock control, orders, and shelf management all mix together with action, survival, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use both your business sense and your reflexes — because in this world, profit and survival are in your hands.</p>",
